ion duration is, for example 500:\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"1066\" height=\"273\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/130399274/510704690-b87ebd43-0b5c-4352-9892-64da7d338aae.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjgxMjA2MTYsIm5iZiI6MTc2ODEyMDMxNiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMzAzOTkyNzQvNTEwNzA0NjkwLWI4N2ViZDQzLTBiNWMtNDM1Mi05ODkyLTY0ZGE3ZDMzOGFhZS5wbmc_.ThApFe6KUXk3M9rjjzEUAgP4oBhsT8JM1X_l5IE25Wk\">\n\n\n\n\nI don't see any visual changes in current master.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734237440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734913351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112454#issuecomment-3734913351","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112454","id":3734913351,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7enkFH","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-11T16:12:10Z","updated_at":"2026-01-11T16:12:10Z","body":"Here's a comparison with classic when there's content:\n\n| Classic | Modern |\n|--------|--------|\n| ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32391c26-177c-4037-92be-7415b2401a54) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32a3d7d6-69d2-4f8d-8590-8aab16db09ef) |\n\nWhen the content is scrolled it's separated by hint shadows, when not scrolled it's separated by content itself (the top category header in that case). When there's no content there's nothing to separate from and we don't draw an empty nested box.\n\nThis is intentional and is similar to how i.e vscode doesn't draw boxes around dock contents, like terminal output:\n\n<img width=\"400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1421c6da-ca6d-4a19-8e46-02a7db36334a\" /><br>\n\nThe beginning of the timeline could be separated from the left column by making either the timeline or the left column darker.\n\nThe horizontal scroll slider is an important enough slider to have its own style, and it will need it when https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107242 feature is implemented, which I'm looking forward to because I think it's super useful.\n\nAs for the bottom bar I'm not super happy with how it currently looks with so many different controls of different sizes. And it doesn't stand out against the editor bottom panel buttons in either theme. It might need a proper iteration and it could be useful to consider different options. It might not need so many buttons, some of them may belong to a context menu, which may lead to a very different look.\n\nTLDR is this isn't final, it will need more work in the future versions. But probably not an extra box around the timeline. There's more context [in this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/13829#discussioncomment-15229814).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3734913351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]